      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "start-with-your-ai"
        },
        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail",
          "scroll": "page"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"width:100%;height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;overflow:auto;container-type:inline-size;background:#eef5fa;color:#153452;font-family:system-ui,sans-serif\"><div style=\"max-width:920px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(20px,5cqw,42px);box-sizing:border-box\"><div style=\"background:#101a36;color:#f7faff;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4cqw;padding:clamp(16px,4cqw,32px);border-top:4px solid #75ffe4\"><div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#75ffe4\">START WITH YOUR AI</div><h1 style=\"margin:10px 0 8px;font-weight:850;font-size:clamp(30px,7cqw,56px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.04em\">Start with your AI</h1><p style=\"font-size:clamp(16px,2.5cqw,20px);margin:0;line-height:1.4\">Talk with your AI about what you want to make. It will put it here.</p></div><div style=\"width:22cqw;max-width:140px\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" r=\"44\" fill=\"#298dcd\" fill-opacity=\".12\" stroke=\"#75ffe4\" stroke-opacity=\".5\"/><ellipse cx=\"60\" cy=\"60\" rx=\"55\" ry=\"18\" transform=\"rotate(-28 60 60)\" stroke=\"#75ffe4\" stroke-opacity=\".65\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M60 23 92 42V78L60 97 28 78V42Z\" fill=\"#1b536d\" stroke=\"#75ffe4\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><path d=\"M60 23V60L92 78M60 60 28 78M28 42 60 60 92 42\" stroke=\"#75ffe4\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M60 42 76 51V69L60 78 44 69V51Z\" fill=\"#c4fff3\"/><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"23\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ffcf82\"/><circle cx=\"28\" cy=\"78\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ffcf82\"/><circle cx=\"92\" cy=\"78\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ffcf82\"/></svg></div></div><div style=\"font-size:clamp(16px,2.5cqw,20px)\"><ol style=\"padding-left:1.5em;margin:24px 0;display:grid;gap:12px;line-height:1.5\"><li style=\"padding:0 0 12px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1ef\"><b style=\"color:#153452\">Start your AI.</b> Click the Twilite icon in the top bar. It copies what your AI needs to know. Paste it into a chat with your AI. It will tell you it understands, and ask what you want to make.</li><li style=\"padding:0 0 12px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1ef\"><b style=\"color:#153452\">Talk it through.</b> Tell your AI about a project, a story, a plan, or an idea. Talk until there is something worth keeping. It may offer to put it in a graph, or you can ask for one.</li><li style=\"padding:0 0 12px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1ef\"><b style=\"color:#153452\">Bring its reply back.</b> Click the paste icon in the toolbar, paste what your AI wrote, and choose Run. Then ask for more in the same chat and paste each reply the same way, or change a card yourself.</li><li style=\"padding:0 0 12px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1ef\"><b style=\"color:#153452\">Look around.</b> Zoom out until each card shows only its title, then in until it shows everything. One graph, three sizes. Click a card to select it.</li><li style=\"padding:0 0 12px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1ef\"><b style=\"color:#153452\">Save it.</b> Saving is part of the editor. With it, click the save icon in the top bar, then Save As: Save locally downloads the file, Save to GitHub keeps it in your repository. New to GitHub? <a href=\"tlz://twilite.zone/tutorial/how-to-guides/github-from-nothing/root.node\">Set it up from nothing</a>.</li><li style=\"padding:0 0 12px 5px;border-bottom:1px solid #d6e1ef\"><b style=\"color:#153452\">Come back.</b> Another day, choose Open graph from the same menu. Your graph is as you left it.</li></ol><p>It worked when the stage fills with what you described.</p></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The Detail view: the page in full. The Method writes it from the masthead, the section and the routes, so edit those and not this.",
        "link": ""
      }
    },
